{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17600","headline":"小园春至偶呈吏部窦郎中 · 羊士谔","name":"小园春至偶呈吏部窦郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松筱虽苦节，冰霜惨其间。\n欣然发佳色，如喜东风还。\n幽抱想前躅，冥鸿度南山。\n春台一以眺，达士亦解颜。\n偃息非老圃，沉吟閟玄关。\n驰晖忽复失，壮气不得闲。\n君子当济物，丹梯谁共攀。\n心期自有约，去扫苍苔斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}